# Publication boundary

- Package `@one-ciel-ai/ciel-runtime`; both branches declare 0.2.51 and the registry reports latest=0.2.51.
- `npm-publish.yml` skips publication when that exact version already exists, and no version bump is requested or made.
- `nightly-20261026` is not a `main` or `nightly` push trigger, so pushing it starts neither CI nor publish.

# Integration verification

Before push: the merged tree must equal origin/nightly except this journal, the merge must pass a whitespace check, and both parent SHAs must be verified. Then push main without force and push `nightly-20261026` with its upstream. Main workflow results are appended after they are observed.

Observed before commit: `git diff --cached --name-only origin/nightly` lists only this journal, and `git diff --cached --check origin/nightly` passes. The check against main reports whitespace only in files under `docs/journal/` that are already on nightly (verbatim console and test captures); no source file is reported.

